1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Problem and scope — invite acceptance bypassed signup reporting.

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Atomic acceptance — invite, expiry, activation, and pending outbox marker are transaction-safe.

3
00:00:43,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Destination claims — ownership tokens and recoverable leases prevent stale workers from overwriting newer work.

4
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Verification — seven real-Django tests, independent review/verifier pass, and qualified CI status.

5
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:57,360
Boundaries — no owner onboarding side effects, CRM writes, backfill, merge, or deployment.
